			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Sets the Lock Screen to a Thrasher cover.

Pick a date opens a date picker. The month and year select the issue. The day is ignored.
Most recent cover uses the newest issue. Random cover picks from the full catalog.
If that month has several covers, a list asks which one.</string>
			</dict>
